<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1840717096"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:50.903"><div begin="20.275" end="38.280" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.275" end="25.075" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.275" end="20.878">当湖</span><span begin="20.878" end="24.142">面澄清 笑可倾</span><span begin="24.142" end="25.075">城</span></p><p begin="25.698" end="29.144" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.698" end="27.002">一眼随我</span><span begin="27.002" end="27.717">万</span><span begin="27.717" end="29.144">里</span></p><p begin="29.405" end="34.133" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="29.405" end="30.009">当乱</span><span begin="30.009" end="34.133">世漂泊 江边应你</span></p><p begin="34.843" end="38.280" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="34.843" end="36.778">一生唤我虞</span><span begin="36.778" end="38.280">姬</span></p></div><div begin="38.540" end="56.789" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="38.540" end="43.424" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.540" end="39.142">当身</span><span begin="39.142" end="42.509">缠银衣 乌骓配</span><span begin="42.509" end="43.424">戟</span></p><p begin="43.971" end="47.282" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.971" end="45.412">本当无人</span><span begin="45.412" end="46.020">能</span><span begin="46.020" end="47.282">敌</span></p><p begin="47.721" end="52.494" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="47.721" end="48.289">若楚</span><span begin="48.289" end="52.494">歌四起 无路退已</span></p><p begin="53.123" end="56.789" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="53.123" end="54.235">我也绝</span><span begin="54.235" end="55.162">无悔</span><span begin="55.162" end="56.789">意</span></p></div><div begin="58.429" end="1:16.787" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="58.429" end="1:02.313" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="58.429" end="1:00.223">亲爱的霸王</span> <span begin="1:00.223" end="1:01.396">该散了</span><span begin="1:01.396" end="1:02.313">啊</span></p><p begin="1:03.097" end="1:07.428" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:03.097" end="1:03.964">准臣妾</span><span begin="1:03.964" end="1:06.515">举剑为你一舞</span><span begin="1:06.515" end="1:07.428">啊</span></p><p begin="1:07.698" end="1:12.290" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:07.698" end="1:08.527">最后再</span><span begin="1:08.527" end="1:09.638">断一缕</span><span begin="1:09.638" end="1:10.247">我</span><span begin="1:10.247" end="1:11.159">的长</span><span begin="1:11.159" end="1:12.290">发</span></p><p begin="1:13.643" end="1:16.787" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:13.643" end="1:14.268">不让</span><span begin="1:14.268" end="1:15.758">你有牵</span><span begin="1:15.758" end="1:16.787">挂</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.797" end="1:35.052" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:16.797" end="1:21.215" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.797" end="1:18.127">亲爱的娘</span><span begin="1:18.127" end="1:18.815">子 我</span><span begin="1:18.815" end="1:20.236">准你退</span><span begin="1:20.236" end="1:21.215">下</span></p><p begin="1:21.457" end="1:25.723" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.457" end="1:23.305">来换我此生最</span><span begin="1:23.305" end="1:23.941">后</span><span begin="1:23.941" end="1:24.208">的</span><span begin="1:24.208" end="1:24.698">冲</span><span begin="1:24.698" end="1:25.723">杀</span></p><p begin="1:25.965" end="1:30.408" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.965" end="1:27.921">请你在地府里</span><span begin="1:27.921" end="1:30.408">等我一下</span></p><p begin="1:31.714" end="1:35.052" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.714" end="1:33.298">迎我与白骨</span><span begin="1:33.298" end="1:35.052">战马</span></p></div><div begin="2:11.581" end="2:30.333" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="2:11.581" end="2:15.385" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:11.581" end="2:13.358">亲爱的赤子</span> <span begin="2:13.358" end="2:15.385">你留下吧</span></p><p begin="2:16.212" end="2:20.591" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:16.212" end="2:17.122">乱世的</span><span begin="2:17.122" end="2:19.340">难题让圣人解</span><span begin="2:19.340" end="2:20.591">答</span></p><p begin="2:20.826" end="2:25.267" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:20.826" end="2:21.649">若我没</span><span begin="2:21.649" end="2:24.264">陪你一路至垓</span><span begin="2:24.264" end="2:25.267">下</span></p><p begin="2:26.488" end="2:30.333" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:26.488" end="2:27.369">屠完城</span><span begin="2:27.369" end="2:27.916">开</span><span begin="2:27.916" end="2:28.969">满鲜</span><span begin="2:28.969" end="2:30.333">花</span></p></div><div begin="2:29.901" end="2:48.549" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:29.901" end="2:34.104" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.901" end="2:30.757">亲爱的</span><span begin="2:30.757" end="2:31.833">姑娘 我</span><span begin="2:31.833" end="2:32.801">错了</span><span begin="2:32.801" end="2:34.104">吗</span></p><p begin="2:34.494" end="2:39.041" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.494" end="2:35.378">西楚霸</span><span begin="2:35.378" end="2:37.912">王的美名传天</span><span begin="2:37.912" end="2:39.041">下</span></p><p begin="2:39.124" end="2:43.912" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.124" end="2:41.064">你看那后人都</span><span begin="2:41.064" end="2:42.359">日趋愈</span><span begin="2:42.359" end="2:43.912">下</span></p><p begin="2:44.794" end="2:48.549" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.794" end="2:47.088">还笑我风骨不</span><span begin="2:47.088" end="2:48.549">化</span></p></div><div begin="2:48.188" end="3:07.814" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:48.188" end="2:52.122" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:48.188" end="2:49.111">亲爱的</span><span begin="2:49.111" end="2:50.282">霸王 有</span><span begin="2:50.282" end="2:52.122">来世吗</span></p><p begin="2:52.825" end="2:57.791" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.825" end="2:53.629">我还欠</span><span begin="2:53.629" end="2:55.768">你一次浪迹</span><span begin="2:55.768" end="2:56.424">天</span><span begin="2:56.424" end="2:57.791">涯</span></p><p begin="2:57.342" end="3:02.028" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:57.342" end="2:58.239">可史书</span><span begin="2:58.239" end="3:00.879">里 我却无人能</span><span begin="3:00.879" end="3:02.028">画</span></p><p begin="3:00.252" end="3:02.812" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.252" end="3:01.804">你无人能</span><span begin="3:01.804" end="3:02.812">画</span></p><p begin="3:03.075" end="3:07.814" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:03.075" end="3:04.010">爱剩寥</span><span begin="3:04.010" end="3:05.469">寥几句</span><span begin="3:05.469" end="3:07.814">话</span></p></div><div begin="3:20.838" end="3:47.331" itunes:songPart="Outro" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="3:20.838" end="3:25.518" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:20.838" end="3:21.441">当湖</span><span begin="3:21.441" end="3:24.705">面澄清 笑可倾</span><span begin="3:24.705" end="3:25.518">城</span></p><p begin="3:26.168" end="3:29.599" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:26.168" end="3:26.816">是谁</span><span begin="3:26.816" end="3:28.161">不懂珍</span><span begin="3:28.161" end="3:29.599">惜</span></p><p begin="3:29.981" end="3:34.741" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:29.981" end="3:30.589">当美</span><span begin="3:30.589" end="3:34.741">景憔悴 映入铜镜</span></p><p begin="3:35.323" end="3:39.000" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:35.323" end="3:36.511">是我对</span><span begin="3:36.511" end="3:37.351">你不</span><span begin="3:37.351" end="3:39.000">起</span></p><p begin="3:39.936" end="3:47.331" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:39.936" end="3:40.702">落得</span><span begin="3:40.702" end="3:42.400">霸王</span><span begin="3:43.048" end="3:44.266">别</span><span begin="3:44.266" end="3:47.331">姬</span></p></div></body></tt>